# URL 控件规范

Shared URL control: `control: 'url'` via `urlControlHtml` / `wireUrlInput` in `online-store/js/app.js`.
Nested Video URL rows use the same paste + validate pattern.

When the user names URL / Video URL / 链接 for a layout, copy, or validation change, update this shared control so every caller gets the change. Do not patch one field only.

## Layout and copy (match Shopify video URL chrome)

- Layout: `.os-fld-pair` — label left, input in the 151px control column (not text stack)
- Interaction: plain input — merchant types or pastes. No library search modal
- Default placeholder: `Paste a link`
- Hint under the input: for `video_url` use `Use a YouTube or Vimeo URL` when schema `info` is empty
- Pair hints align under the control column

## Validation

- Empty is valid (no error)
- `video` kind (`video_url` / `urlKind: 'video'`): accept YouTube, Vimeo, or direct `.mp4` / `.webm` / `.mov` (prototype files)
- Other URL fields: accept `http` / `https` URL shape, plus `/path` and `#hash` (CTA placeholders)
- Invalid: pink input (`.os-input.is-invalid`), alert row with `!` icon + message
- Video error copy: `This link is invalid. Try pasting a complete Vimeo/YouTube link`
- Generic error copy: `This link is invalid. Try pasting a complete URL`
- Validate on input and blur; do not block save in the prototype

## Contrast

- Text / Heading / Content: `.os-fld-stack` (see `text-input.mdc`)
- URL: pair paste input + optional hint + regex error state
